 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Very much normal. Computer screens especially are one of the things that strain our eyes. They are. A good rest them in a dark room helps them recover. A few hours of darkness overnight also helps. Lowering brightness can make them easy to ignore. A plug in dimmer does that too. They can help lot, especially if you know you have a demanding day ahead. They filter out blue light so your eyes don't have to mimic it.",
